SUMMARY:MOLAA Food Pantry
LOCATION:628 Alamitos Ave\, Long Beach\, CA 90802
URL:https://molaa.org/events/2026/08/05/foodpantry
DESCRIPTION:Museum of Latin American Art · Free · https://molaa.org/even
 ts/2026/08/05/foodpantry\n\nIn partnership with Help Me Help You\, MOLAA 
 supports our local communities by hosting a food pantry twice a month. Yo
 u can come to MOLAA and enter through the 6th Street entrance to receive 
 free groceries for your family. Drive-through and walk-up services will b
 e provided. You do not have to show identification or prove your income. 
 No need to register. You can attend without an appointment.
END:VEVENT
