 d images\, the audience becomes Yoko Ono\, as we rediscover and shed ligh
 t on a cultural icon whose career and life path defies expectations and s
 urface-level categorizations. Join us for a first-look workshop of I Am Y
 oko \, a multimedia musical currently in development\, written\, designed
 \, and directed by musician Yuka
END:VEVENT
